seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# §2.4: - (the agent left) closes the turn gone, its box with it, innermost
# first; nothing passed.
see busy
see prompt bash:not-read-only
see -
expect open p1 approval
expect close p1 approval out=gone
expect open t1 turn
expect close t1 turn out=gone steps=1 appr=1
